After deleting the lines,

248
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,000
the elasticity applied on the lines will disappear.

249
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,000
We need to re-apply the elasticity manually,

250
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,000
and set the elasticity ratio to 95%.

251
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Now the shoulder strap has been processed.

252
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:38,000
We are going to start making the cut on the board.

253
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:40,000
We can make the cut on the board in the 2D window,

254
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,000
or we can also make the cut on the board in the 3D window.

255
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,000
As long as you use the 3D drawing tool,

256
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:47,000
you can complete the 3D drawing tool set.

257
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:49,000
These tools will allow you to make the cut on the 3D costume

258
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,000
or on the virtual model freely.

259
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:53,000
Select the 3D version of the cut line tool.

260
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
The operation method of this tool is similar to the 2D drawing line.

261
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
Click on the costume to make the cut line.

262
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Press the Shift key to create the cut line along the horizontal vertical direction.

263
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Click on the cut line along the horizontal line.

264
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:04,000
Click on the starting point again to complete the cut line of a whole circle.

265
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,000
If you want to make a normal cut line,

266
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,000
you can easily create the cut line by holding up the same mouse button.

267
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Press Ctrl Z to return to the starting point.

268
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,000
Press Esc to return to the previous cut.

269
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
A whole circle of lines is completed here.

270
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
You will see that the 3D window looks like a straight line,

271
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,000
but in fact, these lines on the 2D version are not.

272
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
This is the advantage of 3D window.

273
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,000
We can guarantee that it looks like a straight line on the 3D costume.

274
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:27,000
Use the 3D version tool on the editing point and select the whole line once the 2D work is finished.

275
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Press the Shift key to select the transition to the internal pattern.

276
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,000
When the 3D line is changed to the internal line,

277
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,000
you can manually modify the internal line

278
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,000
or directly select the internal line in the 2D window.

279
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:49,000
Next, I will continue to draw a cutout from the side. You can do it according to your own creative design.

280
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:55,000
When creating a shape, press the Ctrl key and click to draw a curve, just like in the 2D window.

281
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:59,000
To make it easier to cut out later, go to the outside of the board and press double-click to complete the creation.

282
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Use the edit tool again to turn the line into an internal shape.

283
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Then go to the 2D window and select this line, then press the right-click to select the cutout.

284
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:14,000
Next, you can continue to create your design according to your needs.

285
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:17,000
After cutting and sewing, remember to turn on the simulation and apply the changes.

286
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
After the design is complete, we will start adjusting the fabric.

287
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:23,000
Since we have a pin design, we will use at least two types of fabrics.

288
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:28,000
For fabric texture, we can go to the Substance file in the library window and get the material.

289
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:31,000
Find the Tracout material and drag it onto the swimsuit.

290
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
The texture of the swimsuit will be replaced by this material.

291
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:43,000
Go to the top right corner of the cloth window, you will see that the entire fabric texture has been replaced.

292
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:48,000
Next, we will create another fabric and place another material, go to the Fabric folder.

293
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:52,000
Change it to a grid diagram and then select any knit fabric.

294
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Because most of these fabrics are elastic, they are suitable for swimsuits.

295
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Here we choose the Cotton Jersey fabric.

296
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:01,000
We need to drag this fabric to the fabric window to add it to a fabric type.

297
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Press the Shift key.

298
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Press the Shift key to select all the fabrics that you want to use.

299
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Then drag the new fabric to the selected sheet and apply this fabric to them.

300
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Next, we will change the color of this fabric.

301
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,000
First, we select the Substance fabric in the fabric window.

302
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,000
In the user definition at the bottom, change the color.

303
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,000
Here I chose black.

304
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:23,000
The properties of the SBA-CR material can be adjusted in the property editor.

305
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,000
Just like in Substance.

306
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:28,000
Then select the Knit fabric and go to the color in the property editor to change the color.

307
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:31,000
You can change the texture texture and color according to your needs.

308
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,000
Here I chose red.

309
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:37,000
After adjusting the fabric texture and color,

310
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:40,000
I will reduce the particle diameter of all the sheets from 20 to 5

311
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,000
to get better fold details.

312
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,000
But here the details of the swimsuit look good.

313
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,000
We just need to reduce it to 15.

314
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Open the simulation application to modify.

315
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:53,000
Now you can export the project in the software

316
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
and go to other 3D software for rendering.

317
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Welcome to check out other summer atmosphere series tutorials

318
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
to learn how to make other content in this scene.

319
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Thank you for watching.

